!packages/mobile/scripts/generate-ios-certs.py
# packages/web/scripts/ is NOT local-only provisioning: prerender.ts is
# invoked by the committed `build` script (tsc && vite build && bun run
# prerender) and must ship to production, and leads.ts/test-lead-emails.ts
# are invoked by committed root package.json scripts (leads:list,
# leads:resend, test:emails). The blanket `scripts/` rule above silently
# excluded this whole directory from every commit until now.
!packages/web/scripts/
